# Squire's Lightblade has flash: on Bot2's turn 2, with Bot2's Ornithopter also on the battlefield, Bot1 casts it for exactly {W}.
# Entering, its trigger refuses Bot2's Ornithopter (the target must be a creature Bot1 controls) and attaches it to one of Bot1's
# Ornithopters, which gains first strike until end of turn (CR 702.7b) and, equipped, gets +1/+0 only (1/2): at the start of
# turn 3 the first strike is gone, the Equipment still attached.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Squire's Lightblade
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Squire's Lightblade.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
